eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZNXNmJV8fXu7dv1hqXeq1Q","review_id":"jVMLFn0k7la1okIUrFe21g","date":"2018-12-14T00:01:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9193922281265259,"text_excerpt":"I am not big on fast-food but Canes is quick and always tasty. We tend to pick Canes when we are in a hurry. My youngest loves the toast and always asks for extra. The chicken fingers are scrumptious and seem to hit the spot everytime. They are not spicy which is good when you have little ones and the sauce is very flavorful. Today we were out holiday shopping and nextdoor to KFC but it was quickly out voted on and to Canes we went."},{"business_id":"ZNXNmJV8fXu7dv1hqXeq1Q","review_id":"w1ZnD7E0f7gTKnBtNWn_fQ","date":"2016-05-06T12:51:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8876528739929199,"text_excerpt":"They sell only chicken finger. I order the 8 piece combo which came with 8 chicken fingers with cane sauce, crinkle thin french fries, cole slaw , toasted butter bread and drink. I didn't notice an option for side orders or non-combo orders unless it was a kids meal. The food was very good. I can't tell you how the coke slaw is because I don't eat Cole slaw"},{"business_id":"ZNXNmJV8fXu7dv1hqXeq1Q","review_id":"-eJWo659dHGTIbHM8zt00Q","date":"2015-08-20T23:16:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8813480138778687,"text_excerpt":"As a kid, I would always get the chicken fingers meal no matter the occasion. Now I don't have to worry about looking like a kid anymore. Simply the best chicken fingers I've ever had. Texas Toast is delicious too!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZNXNmJV8fXu7dv1hqXeq1Q","photo_id":"TfnQwzgoXyO8OUjJBsWZZg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/TfnQwzg